Subject: webui: ship languages.json without the executable bit
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [only upstream's Git tree marks it 100755; its R28 release ZIP has no executable bits]
Drop-when: upstream commits webroot/languages/languages.json as 100644

Keeps every file of the package at the mode it had when it was
reviewed and tested from the R28 release.
---
diff --git a/webroot/languages/languages.json b/webroot/languages/languages.json
old mode 100755
new mode 100644
